    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>World Grappling Tournament</strong>, where only the fastest and most skilled competitors can claim the top spot! This <strong>physics-based grapple platformer</strong> puts you in high-speed challenges, blending <strong>grappling hook movement</strong> with <strong>wingsuit gliding</strong> for an exhilarating experience.<br><br><strong>Master the Course</strong> \u2013 Swing, soar, and thread through intricate levels designed for <strong>momentum-driven gameplay</strong>.<br><br><strong>Chase the Best Times</strong> \u2013 Beat the par times to unlock new levels and earn stars.<br><br><strong>Optimize &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Unlock new equipment and refine your skills to shave time off your runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb The Leaderboard</strong> \u2013 Compete against other players to claim the fastest time\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>World Grappling Tournament</strong>, where only the fastest and most skilled competitors can claim the top spot! This <strong>physics-based grapple platformer</strong> puts you in high-speed challenges, blending <strong>grappling hook movement</strong> with <strong>wingsuit gliding</strong> for an exhilarating experience.<br><br><strong>Master the Course</strong> \u2013 Swing, soar, and thread through intricate levels designed for <strong>momentum-driven gameplay</strong>.<br><br><strong>Chase the Best Times</strong> \u2013 Beat the par times to unlock new levels and earn stars.<br><br><strong>Optimize &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Unlock new equipment and refine your skills to shave time off your runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb The Leaderboard</strong> \u2013 Compete against other players to claim the fastest time\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Equip your Grappling Hook and swing into the action. Master the physics-based movement, upgrade your gear, and utilize different equipment to win the championship! Beat the par times to progress and claim your spot at the top of the leaderboard!",
